'''Endermites''' are small [[Mobs]] similar to [[Silverfish]] found in {{Zone|The End}}. They are spawned by [[Seer]]s and can also spawn when a [[Seer]] dies. They are also sometimes spawned by breaking [[End Stone]] with anything other than a [[Stonk]]. 

== Spawning ==
Lower level '''Endermites''' have a chance to spawn when breaking {{Item|End Stone}} with anything other than a {{Item|Stonk}}.

Higher level '''Endermites''' can be spawned by {{MobSprite|Seer}}s as projectiles.

